    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d562">

                <pb facs="0528" n="516" sameAs="frus:frus1944v05/pg516"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">381.81/327: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting American Representative to the French
                        Committee of National Liberation</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Chapin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Algiers</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-04-06T17:00:00+02:00">April 6, 1944—5
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received April 7—9:52 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1139. Your 926, March 28, 2 p.m. American military authorities here state that
                    they have made exhaustive investigation and have failed to discover any
                    indications whatsoever that an agreement such as that mentioned in first
                    paragraph of Russell’s telegram 76, March 24, 5 p.m. was entered into between
                    American and French authorities in Algiers. At their request we phoned Russell
                    and asked for further particulars which he said he would immediately endeavor to
                    obtain for transmission here.</p>
                <p>Will telegraph further developments.</p>
                <p>Your 926, March 28, 2 p.m. was repeated to Tangier, Casablanca and Rabat.</p>
                <p>Sent to the Department as 1139; repeated to Tangier as 25; repeated to Rabat as
                    5; repeated to Casablanca as 6.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chapin</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
